       "editor": "<p>BrickPoint is a construction-materials supplier based in Punjab, Pakistan. We supply bricks and the materials a project needs: cement, crush, sand, steel, pipes, construction chemicals and finishing items.</p><p>Our production companies are <strong>Masha Allah Bricks Company</strong>, <strong>Fine Bricks Company</strong> and <strong>SS7 Bricks</strong>. Materials come from our own production and from trusted suppliers in the same supply chain.</p><p><em>Edit this text with your own verified company story, milestones and team details. BrickPoint never publishes claims that cannot be confirmed.</em></p>",
